# Repo-root ignores. The Next app (partnermax-site/) also has its own
# .gitignore for framework internals; these are repo-wide safety nets so
# nothing leaks regardless of which directory you run git from.

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Dependencies & build output (any nested project)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/.vercel/

# Secrets — ignore every .env* anywhere, but keep the committed example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs & debug
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo
